<Positioned left="66" top="94"><Text fontSize="15" color="#9FB0CCFF" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" fontStyle="NORMAL">How far below the 220 DU threshold each year's ozone fell</Text></Positioned>
<Positioned left="66" top="119.25999999999999"><Text fontSize="12" color="#9FB0CCFF" fontFamily="Noto Sans Mono CJK SC" fontStyle="NORMAL">Area says how wide the hole is. Depth says how little ozone is left. The two records do not peak in the same year — 2000 was the widest, 1994 the deepest.</Text></Positioned>
